        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "A progressive political orientation is compatible with support for Israel.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Being present during the Capitol riot would have been more traumatic than experiencing it secondhand.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The host believes that discussing politics through personal experience enhances credibility.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience values understanding the emotional impact of national events on public officials.",
        "confidence": 0.87
