        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Impeaching a U.S. president twice is unprecedented and therefore deeply significant.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the Capitol attack as a direct consequence of political leadership incitement.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
