        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience (the member of Congress) values accountability and institutional integrity in governance.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Political discourse around presidential removal should involve multiple constitutional mechanisms.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
