  {
    "episode_id": 66360,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66360.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "So there are three outcomes. House majority is required for impeachment. A Senate supermajority is required for conviction. And then, once impeached and convicted, a Senate majority is required for disqualification. So the ultimate goal is not simply to remove Donald Trump from office, but to disqualify him from ever pursuing federal office again, because he has shown himself to be a lethal threat to the republic. He's a clear and present danger to the constitutional republic.",
